## Credentials. Nothing under Secret/ is ever committed, and the pattern below
## catches a provider file downloaded straight into the project by mistake.
Secret/
client_secret*.json

## Claude Code. The settings and the hook are the project's and are committed,
## so that whichever machine this is opened on is held to the same rules. Only
## what is personal to one machine stays out.
.claude/settings.local.json

